{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43324","headline":"龟兹闻莺 · 吕敞","name":"龟兹闻莺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"边树正参差，新莺复陆离。\n娇非胡俗变，啼是汉音移。\n绣羽花间覆，繁声风外吹。\n人言曾不辨，鸟语却相知。\n出谷情何寄，迁乔义取斯。\n今朝乡陌伴，几处坐高枝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕敞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43324.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43324","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}